    "summary": "[Diseased Influence](vsdata:ability/death-guard.mortarion.diseased-influence) on Mortarion is rewritten. Right after an enemy unit's **[Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)**, **[Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)** or **[Fall Back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)** ends 8\" or less from a **DEATH GUARD** unit of yours, that **DEATH GUARD** unit may make a Normal move, up to 5\", if it is:\n\n- no more than 6\" from Mortarion\n- outside **Engagement Range** of all enemy units",
